gametitle=Primal (NTSC-U) [SCUS-97142] (FCD89DC3)

// Widescreen sections: tick ONE ratio only. Keep the in-game option Options > Display > widescreen ON.
// With in-game widescreen OFF the game stays stock 4:3 under every section.
// Hor+ = wider than 16:9, extra view left/right. Vert+ = narrower than 16:9, same width as 16:9, extra view top/bottom.
// Pause menu: only the side column (logo, orbs, portrait, icons) is corrected; panels/text stay stretched.
// Gameplay HUD is not corrected. FMVs: set PCSX2 FMV Aspect Ratio to Widescreen (16:9).
// Changes take effect on the next camera setup (scene change, cutscene, or toggling in-game widescreen).
// Switching sections while running may leave the previous section's code until the game is restarted.

[Widescreen 21:9 (Hor+)]
author=Sevastopol
description=64:27 (2.3704). Tick one ratio only. In-game widescreen must be ON.
