[60 FPS (video-aware)]
author=Sevastopol (video-aware hook). Based on the 60 fps code 204874FC=1, reportedly by asasega (unverified)
description=60 fps in gameplay and real-time cutscenes; prerecorded videos keep stock 30 fps pacing so they no longer play too fast or end early. Do not use together with the old 60 fps cheat. Can be combined with any one widescreen section.
// vsync handler 0x002F7638 reloads its countdown from the frame divider 0x004874FC (stock 2).
// Hook: if no video is playing (movie buffer ptr 0x0048772C == 0) and divider == 2, count to 1 instead.
